# ******************************************************************
# * File         : .dockerignore
# * Application  : CardDemo
# * Type         : Docker build context exclusion rules
# * Function     : Keeps the build context that `docker build` uploads to the
# *                daemon small and deterministic, WITHOUT dropping any source,
# *                frozen contract, fixture, migration or evidence artefact the
# *                Maven build and the eight validation gates depend on. No
# *                ignore, formatter or linter configuration previously existed
# *                anywhere in this repository, so this convention is
# *                ESTABLISHED rather than inherited.
# * Derived from : No legacy equivalent - the mainframe had no container image.
# *                The two content trees excluded below are the ones the
# *                migration plan puts out of scope: samples/ (the z/OS compile
# *                templates BATCMP.jcl, CICCMP.jcl and BMSCMP.jcl, the three
# *                build procedures, and two binary emulator runtime archives
# *                under samples/m2 totalling 902 KB, conceptually superseded
# *                by pom.xml) and app/data/EBCDIC/ (twelve .PS datasets kept
# *                as byte-level codepage reference only and never parsed by
# *                the build). CONTRIBUTING.md:33-34 asks contributors to focus
# *                on the specific change and to ensure local tests pass, which
# *                is why this file is surgical and why the sweep below exists.
